      "arguments": [],
      "capabilities": [],
      "description": "copy the roadmap approval record of the sdc.direction case into this case, unchanged; it approves nothing, and the record keeps the producer and roadmap revision it was approved with. Only while this case holds no roadmap approval record about the current roadmap revision: a second copy with another result would leave roadmap.approved unknown for good. A new roadmap revision sets the old record aside and makes it admissible again",
      "effect": "read",
